      "source_xml_line": 2134,
      "string_id": "otshel_hello_dialog_phrase_9",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yeah, there's these... Naah, forget it. Anyway, you seem alright, give me a shout if you need supplies and we can make a deal. I dabble in some trade on behalf of my associates, so I can get you something that interests you.. for a price.",
